WEBVTT

00:17:28.292 --> 00:17:31.059
But if either of you

00:17:31.083 --> 00:17:34.809
in the next week or two tests positive,

00:17:34.833 --> 00:17:37.851
your phone will be able
to communicate to all the people

00:17:37.875 --> 00:17:39.809
which it exchanged token with,

00:17:39.833 --> 00:17:44.393
to say, "Uh oh, someone who
you were close to in the last two weeks

00:17:44.417 --> 00:17:45.768
has tested positive.

00:17:45.792 --> 00:17:47.143
You've got to isolate."

00:17:47.167 --> 00:17:50.809
That's basically how it works,
it's done that way.

00:17:50.833 --> 00:17:52.101
DA: Exactly.

00:17:52.125 --> 00:17:54.851
CA: And then after, what,
three or four weeks,

00:17:54.875 --> 00:17:57.643
the tokens can actually autodelete?

00:17:57.667 --> 00:17:59.476
They go, they're not there anymore.

00:17:59.500 --> 00:18:01.018
DA: They expire, that's right.